# Allowlisted container vulnerabilities.
#
# An id here means: this HIGH or CRITICAL has a fix available upstream and we
# are choosing not to take it yet. Write the reason on the line above it, and
# a date - an allowlist without dates becomes permanent by accident.
#
# Findings with NO fix available do not belong here. They are reported by
# `make image-scan` on every run and are deliberately not gated on, because a
# gate nobody can act on is a gate people learn to ignore.
#
# Format: one id per line. Comment lines directly above an id are read as its
# reason and printed next to it in the scan output.
